                                                "sense_id": "4c4472fc-b630-3584-b6e9-8cdd4eb028e3",
                                                "text": "The next day, when Hsi-men Ch’ing returned from the yamen, he had the chests opened up and took out a bolt of block printed tussore fabric from the Imperial Silk Manufactory in the south."
